<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" version="1.1" creator="mtl_bike tools/build.py" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1 http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1/gpx.xsd"><metadata><name>Day 4 (Wednesday Oct 7): Schuylerville to Ticonderoga, NY</name><desc>64.3 mi (103.5 km), about +2,200 ft. Routed on OpenStreetMap along the official trails.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="43.10274" lon="-73.57966"><name>Hotel: Dovegate Inn</name><desc>Mile 78.7. 184 Broad St, Schuylerville, NY. (518) 695-3699. Small inn with a few rooms on Broad St in Schuylerville village, with an on-site restaurant (Kitchen at the Dovegate Inn, 518-695-6095). Book early: limited rooms. Ask about bike storage.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.54997" lon="-73.39814"><name>Lunch: Stewart's Shops #211</name><desc>Mile 38.4, 0.3 mi off route. 60 Poultney St, Whitehall, NY. . Convenience store with hot food and coffee. The reliable food stop in Whitehall.</desc><sym>Restaurant</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.84798" lon="-73.43417"><name>Hotel: Circle Court Motel</name><desc>Mile 64.3. 6 Montcalm St, Ticonderoga, NY. (518) 585-7660. Small motel at the west end of Montcalm St, near the NY-9N/22 junction; Stewart's (26 Montcalm St) is nearby.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.85829" lon="-73.42782"><name>Hotel: Best Western Plus Ticonderoga Inn &amp; Suites</name><desc>Mile 63.8, 0.7 mi off route. 260 Burgoyne Rd, Ticonderoga, NY. (518) 585-2378. On the south side of town, right on the route.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.41500" lon="-73.49100"><name>Bike: Walker's Farm, Home &amp; Tack</name><desc>Mile 25.4, 0.2 mi off route. 5565 State Route 4, Fort Ann, NY. (518) 639-5223. Farm and hardware store, NOT a bike shop: basic tools and supplies only. Listed Mon to Fri 8 to 6, Sat 8 to 5, Sun 9 to 4.</desc><sym>Bike Trail</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.26976" lon="-73.58040"><name>Station: Fort Edward-Glens Falls</name><desc>Mile 13.2, 0.1 mi off route.</desc><sym>Train</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.55477" lon="-73.40323"><name>Station: Whitehall</name><desc>Mile 38.7, 0.0 mi off route.</desc><sym>Train</sym></wpt>
